      "name": "State Mutation Helpers",
      "description": "Higher-level functions that modify account state through the modify_state pattern. Includes ether transfer, balance setting, nonce incrementing, and code setting. The modify_state function applies a mutation callback and enforces the empty-account cleanup invariant.",
      "invariants": [
        {
          "id": "INV-MUT-001",
          "text": "After any modification via modify_state, if the resulting account exists and has zero nonce, empty code, and zero balance, the account is destroyed (cleaned up)."
