          "id": "INV-MUT-002",
          "text": "move_ether: The sender must have sufficient balance (sender.balance >= amount), otherwise an AssertionError is raised."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-MUT-003",
          "text": "move_ether: Total ether is conserved -- the amount deducted from the sender equals the amount added to the recipient (before empty-account cleanup)."
        }
