          "id": "INV-GAS-002",
          "text": "FLOOR_CALLDATA_COST (10 gas per token, EIP-7623) must always be greater than or equal to STANDARD_CALLDATA_TOKEN_COST (4 gas per token), enforcing a minimum calldata gas floor."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-GAS-003",
          "text": "TX_MAX_GAS_LIMIT is 16,777,216 (2^24), providing an upper bound on the gas limit for any single transaction."
        }
