      "description": "Defines the five transaction types supported in the Osaka fork: LegacyTransaction (pre-EIP-1559), AccessListTransaction (EIP-2930), FeeMarketTransaction (EIP-1559), BlobTransaction (EIP-4844), and SetCodeTransaction (EIP-7702). Also defines the Access helper structure and the Transaction union type.",
